/* GrowDailyWidget — Arabic.

   ONLY the widget gallery's own titles and descriptions live here, plus the
   three Control titles. Everything a widget FACE draws is in
   WidgetStrings.swift instead, and the split is not a preference: the system
   reads the strings below before any of our code runs, so they follow the
   DEVICE language, while a face is drawn by our code and can follow the
   app's own language toggle. A user with the app in Arabic on an English
   phone therefore gets Arabic faces and English gallery titles, which is the
   best the platform allows.

   Keys are the English source strings. Wording here is a first pass in easy
   spoken Arabic and is Aziz's to change. */

